# Kafka, openbao, clarity and data-science alignment (MEDULLA-DATAPLAT-VOCAB-R008.3).
#
# Each package-local term aligns to its data-platform term so the two cannot
# drift silently: classes `rdfs:subClassOf` (the package term is the emitted
# shape, the dp: term is the engine-side vocabulary), properties
# `owl:equivalentProperty`. Package terms live in the shared
# `http://knuckles.team/kg#` namespace.

@prefix dp: <http://knuckles.team/kg/data-platform#> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix : <http://knuckles.team/kg#> .

# --- kafka (kafka-mcp, kafka.ttl) ---

:Topic rdfs:subClassOf dp:Topic .
:Partition rdfs:subClassOf dp:Partition .
:ConsumerGroup rdfs:subClassOf dp:ConsumerGroup .
:partitionOf owl:equivalentProperty dp:partitionOf .
:subscribesTo owl:equivalentProperty dp:subscribesTo .
:groupState owl:equivalentProperty dp:groupState .

# --- openbao (openbao-mcp, openbao.ttl) ---

:VaultServer rdfs:subClassOf dp:DataStore .
:SecretMount rdfs:subClassOf dp:SecretEngine .
:Policy rdfs:subClassOf dp:AccessPolicy .

# --- clarity (clarity-api, clarity.ttl) ---

:ClarityProject rdfs:subClassOf dp:AnalyticsSite .
:BehaviorInsight rdfs:subClassOf dp:BehaviorMetric .
:metricName owl:equivalentProperty dp:metricName .
:dimensionName owl:equivalentProperty dp:dimensionName .
:numOfDays owl:equivalentProperty dp:windowDays .

# --- data-science (data-science-mcp, datascience.ttl) ---

:TrainingRun rdfs:subClassOf dp:TrainingRun .
:ModelArtifact rdfs:subClassOf dp:Model .
:trainedOn owl:equivalentProperty dp:trainedOn .
:producedModel owl:equivalentProperty dp:producedModel .
:metricValue owl:equivalentProperty dp:metricValue .
